€ë¯¸ì§€ ê°ì†Œ / ë°±ì–´íƒ ëŒ€ë¯¸ì§€ ì¦ê°€\níŒŒê´´ëœ ê°ì¸ : ì¶”ê°€ ëŒ€ë¯¸ì§€ ê°ì†Œ / í¬ë¦¬í‹°ì»¬ í™•ë¥  ì¦ê°€\nì €ì£¼ë°›ìŒ : ìµœëŒ€ HP/ë°©ì–´ë ¥ ê°ì†Œ / í¬ë¦¬í‹°ì»¬ ëŒ€ë¯¸ì§€ ì¦ê°€\nìœ„ì¡° ì˜í˜¹ : ê³µê²©ë ¥ ê°ì†Œ / ë°©ì–´ ê´€í†µ ì¦ê°€","A negative trait that attaches to artifacts. The higher the tag's grade, the greater the penalty it inflictsâ€”causing serious harm to the bearer, though it occasionally has an upside.\n\n<color=#c0603a><b>Negative Tag</b></color>\nCorroded : Defense Decrease / Defense Penetration Increase\nDiscolored : Fire Resistance Decrease / Water Resistance Increase\nUseless Attachment : Movement Speed Decrease\nAnnoying Noise : Wind Resistance Decrease\nStrange Odor : Water Resistance Decrease\nLacking Aesthetic Sense : Back Attack Damage Decrease / Attack Power Increase\nTroublesome Rumor : HP Regeneration Decrease\nToo Shiny : Critical Hit Rate/Critical Damage Decrease / Weak Point Damage Increase\nExcessively Heavy : Movement Speed Decrease / Defense Increase\nToo Small : Defense/Movement Speed Decrease / Basic Attack Speed Increase\nMade-in-Yesterday : Defense Decrease\nExaggerated Legend : Attack Power/Defense Decrease / Critical Damage Increase\nAmbiguous Function : Skill Haste Decrease\nCrude Repair Marks : Defense Penetration Decrease\nDistorted Balance : Attack Power/Max HP Decrease / Basic Attack Speed Increase\nIncomplete Fragment : Critical Hit Rate Decrease / Max HP Increase\nUnfinished Piece : Max HP Decrease / Attack Power Increase\nMetal Fatigue : Damage Resistance Decrease\nOminous Mark : Defense/Tolerable Artifact Contamination Decrease / Critical Hit Rate Increase\nSevered Language : Weak Point Damage Decrease / Basic Attack Speed Increase\nWeakened Magic : Basic Attack Speed Decrease / Defense Increase\nUnpleasant Mascot Engraved : Tolerable Artifact Contamination Decrease\n\n<color=#cc2222><b>â—† Curse-Tier Negative Tag</b></color>\nProfane Contamination : Tolerable Artifact Contamination Decrease / Weak Poin