o ao redor. O Ãºltimo golpe inflige {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} nos inimigos. Todos os ataques aplicam {EStatType:Penetration} bÃ´nus. Torna-se <color=#3d840e><b>ImparÃ¡vel</b></color> durante o uso.\n\n<b>Carga NecessÃ¡ria</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (ganha <color=#ffcc00>21</color> automaticamente por segundo)\n<b>Dano de Corte</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Corte Final</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (SupressÃ£o <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Efeito Especial</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Auflade-Ultimative</b>\nHackt alles in der Umgebung schnell nieder. Der letzte Hieb verursacht {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} bei Feinden. Alle Angriffe wenden Bonus-{EStatType:Penetration} an. Wird wÃ¤hrend des Einsatzes <color=#3d840e><b>Unaufhaltbar</b></color>.\n\n<b>Erforderliche Ladung</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (auto <color=#ffcc00>+21</color>/s)\n<b>Hiebschaden</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Finaler Hieb</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (UnterdrÃ¼ckung <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Spezialeffekt</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Ultime de Charge</b>\nHache rapidement tout ce qui l'entoure. Le dernier coup inflige {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} aux ennemis. Toutes les attaques appliquent {EStatType:Penetration} bonus. Devient <color=#3d840e><b>Imparable</b></color> pendant l'utilisation.\n\n<b>Charge Requise</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (gagne <color=#ffcc00>21</color> auto par seconde)\n<b>DÃ©gÃ¢ts de Tranche</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Tranche Finale</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (Suppression <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Effet SpÃ©cial</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Definitiva de Carga</b>\nCorta rÃ¡pidamente todo lo que hay alrededor. El Ãºltimo golpe inflige {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} a los enemigos. Todos los ataques aplican {EStatType:Penetration} bÃ´nus. Se vuelve <color=#3d840e><b>Imparable</b></color> durante el uso.\n\n<b>Carga Necesaria</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (gana <color=#ffcc00>21</color> automÃ¡ticamente por segundo)\n<b>DaÃ±o de Tajo</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Tajo Final</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (SupresiÃ³n <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Efecto Especial</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Definitiva a Carica</b>\nTaglia rapidamente tutto intorno. L'ultimo colpo infligge {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} ai nemici. Tutti gli attacchi applicano {EStatType:Penetration} bonus. Diventa <color=#3d840e><b>Inarrestabile</b></color> durante l'uso.\n\n<b>Carica Richiesta</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (guadagna <color=#ffcc00>21</color> automaticamente al secondo)\n<b>Danno Taglio</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Taglio Finale</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (Soppressione <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Effetto Speciale</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Final de Carga</b>\nCorta rapidamente tudo ao redor. O Ãºltimo golpe inflige {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} nos inimigos. Todos os ataques aplicam {EStatType:Penetration} bÃ´nus. Torna-se <color=#3d840e><b>ImparÃ¡vel</b></color> durante o uso.\n\n<b>Carga NecessÃ¡ria</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (ganha <color=#ffcc00>21</color> automaticamente por segundo)\n<b>Dano de Corte</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Corte Final</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (SupressÃ£o <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Efeito Especial</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Åadowane Ostateczne</b>\nBÅ‚yskawicznie tnie wszystko dookoÅ‚a. Ostatni cios nakÅ‚ada {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} na wrogÃ³w. Wszystkie ataki stosujÄ… bonus {EStatType:Penetration}. Podczas uÅ¼ycia aktywny jest <color=#3d840e><b>Nieuchronny</b></color>.\n\n<b>Wymagany Åadunek</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (auto <color=#ffcc00>+21</color>/s)\n<b>ObraÅ¼enia CiÄ™cia</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Finalne CiÄ™cie</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (StÅ‚umienie <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Specjalny Efekt</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>Tá»‘i ThÆ°á»£ng TÃ­ch NÄƒng</b>\nNhanh chÃ³ng chÃ©m táº¥t cáº£ xung quanh. ÄÃ²n chÃ©m cuá»‘i Ã¡p {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} lÃªn káº» Ä‘á»‹ch. Táº¥t cáº£ táº¥n cÃ´ng Ã¡p {EStatType:Penetration} thÃªm. Trong lÃºc thi triá»ƒn sáº½ á»Ÿ tráº¡ng thÃ¡i <color=#3d840e><b>Báº¥t kháº£ cáº£n</b></color>.\n\n<b>TÃ­ch NÄƒng Cáº§n</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (tá»± Ä‘á»™ng <color=#ffcc00>+21</color>/giÃ¢y)\n<b>SÃ¡t thÆ°Æ¡ng ChÃ©m</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>ChÃ©m Cuá»‘i</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (Ãp cháº¿ <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Hiá»‡u á»©ng Äáº·c biá»‡t</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,<b>ÅžarjlÄ± Nihai</b>\nÃ‡evresindeki her ÅŸeyi hÄ±zla keser. Son kesim dÃ¼ÅŸmanlara {EStatusEffectTag:Knockback} uygular. TÃ¼m saldÄ±rÄ±lar bonus {EStatType:Penetration} uygular. KullanÄ±m sÄ±rasÄ±nda <color=#3d840e><b>Durdurulamaz</b></color> olur.\n\n<b>Gerekli Åžarj</b>: <color=#ffcc00>7150</color> (saniyede otomatik <color=#ffcc00>+21</color>)\n<b>Kesim HasarÄ±</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107000}%</color> x 6\n<b>Son Kesim</b>: <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107002}%</color> (BaskÄ± <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107003}</color>)\n<b>Ã–zel Etki</b>: {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>{E:100107001}%</color>,
