}</color>","Äá»ƒ sá»‘ng sÃ³t, Ä‘Ã£ mang trong mÃ¬nh má»™t cá»• váº­t bá»‹ Ã´ nhiá»…m thay cho trÃ¡i tim Ä‘Ã£ máº¥t. TÃ¹y theo tÃ¬nh huá»‘ng, thá»ƒ xÃ¡c vÃ  cá»• váº­t sáº½ phÃ¡t huy hiá»‡u quáº£ khÃ¡c nhau.\n\n<color=#3d840e><b>KÃ½ á»©c cá»§a thá»ƒ xÃ¡c</b></color>\nKhi HP á»Ÿ má»©c {E:100138077}% trá»Ÿ xuá»‘ng, tÄƒng {EStatType:MoveSpeedPercent}, {EStatType:DefPercent} vÃ  {EStatType:AtkSpeedPercent}.\n\n<color=#3d840e><b>Cá»™ng hÆ°á»Ÿng cá»§a cá»• váº­t</b></color>\nKhi Stress á»Ÿ má»©c 60 trá»Ÿ lÃªn, tÄƒng {EStatType:CriticalDamagePercent} vÃ  {EStatType:Penetration}.\n\n<b>Táº¥n cÃ´ng cÆ¡ báº£n</b>: Má»—i láº§n báº¯n tiÃªu tá»‘n 1 Ä‘áº¡n; cáº§n náº¡p láº¡i sau khi báº¯n 6 viÃªn. ÄÃ´i khi xuyÃªn qua káº» Ä‘á»‹ch trÃªn Ä‘Æ°á»ng tháº³ng, táº¥n cÃ´ng tá»‘i Ä‘a 3 má»¥c tiÃªu. ViÃªn Ä‘áº¡n cuá»‘i Ä‘Æ°á»£c tÄƒng cÆ°á»ng vÃ  luÃ´n xuyÃªn thá»§ng.\n<color=#ffcc00>{E:100138001}%</color> / ViÃªn cuá»‘i <color=#ffcc00>{E:100138002}%</color>\n<b>KÃ½ á»©c cá»§a thá»ƒ xÃ¡c</b>: {EStatType:MoveSpeedPercent} <color=#ffcc00>+{E:100138070}%</color> / {EStatType:DefPercent} <color=#ffcc00>+{E:100138071}%</color> / {EStatType:AtkSpeedPercent} <color=#ffcc00>+{E:100138072}%</color>\n<b>Cá»™ng hÆ°á»Ÿng cá»§a cá»• váº­t</b>: {EStatType:CriticalDamagePercent} <color=#ffcc00>+{E:100138073}%</color> / {EStatType:Penetration} <color=#ffcc00>+{E:100138074}</color>","Hayatta kalmak iÃ§in kaybettiÄŸi kalbin yerine kirlenmiÅŸ bir eser barÄ±ndÄ±rdÄ±. Duruma gÃ¶re beden ve eser farklÄ± etkiler ortaya Ã§Ä±karÄ±r.\n\n<color=#3d840e><b>Bedenin AnÄ±sÄ±</b></color>\nHP {E:100138077}% veya altÄ±ndayken {EStatType:MoveSpeedPercent}, {EStatType:DefPercent} ve {EStatType:AtkSpeedPercent} artar.\n\n<color=#3d840e><b>Eserin RezonansÄ±</b></color>\nStres 60 veya Ã¼zerindeyken {EStatType:CriticalDamagePercent} ve {EStatType:Penetration} artar.\n\n<b>Temel SaldÄ±rÄ±</b>: Her atÄ±ÅŸta 1 mermi tÃ¼ketir; 6 atÄ±ÅŸtan sonra yeniden doldurma gerektirir. Zaman zaman dÃ¼z hat Ã¼zerindeki dÃ¼ÅŸmanlarÄ± delerek en 